    "faq_questions": {
     "type": "group",
     "settings": {
      "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
      "wrap_in_card": false,
      "layout_type": "flex",
      "width_desktop": 100,
      "layout_direction_desktop": "column",
      "layout_gap_desktop": 10,
      "same_as_desktop": true,
      "width_mobile": 100,
      "layout_direction_mobile": "column",
      "layout_gap_mobile": 10,
      "use_global_container_padding": true,
      "padding_horizontal": 30,
      "padding_vertical": 30
     },
     "blocks": {
      "faq_titre": {
       "type": "text",
       "settings": {
        "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
        "text": "<h3>Questions fréquentes</h3>",
        "text_style": "h3",
        "alignment": "left",
        "alignment_mobile": "left",
        "margin_bottom": 10
       },
       "blocks": {}
      },
      "faq_accordions": {
       "type": "accordions",
       "settings": {
        "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
        "icon": "caret",
        "dividers": true
       },
       "blocks": {
        "faq_q1": {
         "type": "_accordion",
         "settings": {
          "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
          "heading": "C'est difficile ?",
          "open_by_default": false,
          "icon": "none"
         },
         "blocks": {
          "faq_r1": {
           "type": "text",
           "settings": {
            "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
            "text": "<p>Non, mais ça s'apprend. Les trois gestes qui font réussir ou rater une première pièce — tendre la toile, enfiler le fil, tenir la machine — sont expliqués pas à pas dans nos vidéos. Tu n'es jamais laissée seule devant ta toile.</p>",
            "text_style": "paragraph"
           },
           "blocks": {}
          }
         },
         "block_order": ["faq_r1"]
        },
        "faq_q2": {
         "type": "_accordion",
         "settings": {
          "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
          "heading": "Il me faut quoi en plus du kit ?",
          "open_by_default": false,
          "icon": "none"
         },
         "blocks": {
          "faq_r2": {
           "type": "text",
           "settings": {
            "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
            "text": "<p>Un cadre pour tendre ta toile — notre guide t'explique comment le fabriquer simplement ou où l'acheter près de chez toi — et de la colle pour la finition du dos.</p>",
            "text_style": "paragraph"
           },
           "blocks": {}
          }
         },
         "block_order": ["faq_r2"]
        },
        "faq_q3": {
         "type": "_accordion",
         "settings": {
          "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
          "heading": "Cut et Loop, c'est quoi la différence ?",
          "open_by_default": false,
          "icon": "none"
         },
         "blocks": {
          "faq_r3": {
           "type": "text",
           "settings": {
            "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
            "text": "<p>Cut = poils coupés, rendu velours. Loop = poils bouclés, rendu texturé. Ton gun 2-en-1 fait les deux, et notre tutoriel dédié te montre comment passer de l'un à l'autre.</p>",
            "text_style": "paragraph"
           },
           "blocks": {}
          }
         },
         "block_order": ["faq_r3"]
        },
        "faq_q4": {
         "type": "_accordion",
         "settings": {
          "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
          "heading": "La machine s'entretient ?",
          "open_by_default": false,
          "icon": "none"
         },
         "blocks": {
          "faq_r4": {
           "type": "text",
           "settings": {
            "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
            "text": "<p>Oui, et c'est simple : une goutte d'huile toutes les 2 heures d'utilisation. C'est dans ta notice et en vidéo — et ça change la durée de vie de ta machine.</p>",
            "text_style": "paragraph"
           },
           "blocks": {}
          }
         },
         "block_order": ["faq_r4"]
        },
        "faq_q5": {
         "type": "_accordion",
         "settings": {
          "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
          "heading": "Et si ça ne me plaît pas ?",
          "open_by_default": false,
          "icon": "none"
         },
         "blocks": {
          "faq_r5": {
           "type": "text",
           "settings": {
            "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
            "text": "<p>Tu disposes de ton droit de rétractation de 14 jours. Écris-nous et nous trouverons une solution ensemble.</p>",
            "text_style": "paragraph"
           },
           "blocks": {}
          }
         },
         "block_order": ["faq_r5"]
        }
       },
       "block_order": ["faq_q1", "faq_q2", "faq_q3", "faq_q4", "faq_q5"]
      }
     },
     "block_order": ["faq_titre", "faq_accordions"]
    }
   },
